        "id": 333
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-12T19:59:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Addressed in PS69.\n\nThe actual last posted WQE and consumed-packet count are now passed into the chained/TSO helper. A NO_SLOTS result or a dropped GSO packet preserves the prefix completion target. The 255 SEND + GSO case completes the SEND prefix, releases its buffers, then successfully retries and completes the GSO packet, including counter/ring wrap cases. The original PS68 fails the same completion assertion.",
      "parentUuid": "8025197e_7b6fb731",
